Cremater:
It'd be good if horde's kills affected the necromancer's alignment, because it's very hard to kill demons without a horde. And you can't really kill most of the mobs as an evil necro, because it seems many of the best exp monsies are good align and go aggro to an evil necro. At least necros need some way to change their align towards good :)
Cathoris:
Try changing skill adjectives where quite good is better than good. as it implies.  Quite being a little more than just good... just as quite low is a little bit lower than low.
Cathoris:
so it reads "Good, Quite Good, Very Good".  also.. mediocre is has more negative cognitive meaning than average or adequate.. ie:  mediocre, adequate, average.  meaning it's okay I guess, It's good enough, it's right in the middle.
Cathoris:
and quite low should be before low as it means "lower"
